window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Hell's never been hotter with the long-lost spawn of Satan firmly where she belongs. With a shiny new corporeal body and deep desperation for adventure, Mara is ready to paint the town red.</p> <p>After nearly a decade of possessing humans to survive, Mara is looking for answers and she won't stop until she has the full picture. Despite her paranoia, she manages the loyalty of three very attractive demons. Whether she'll use this army for war or for her own personal pleasure is yet to be seen.</p> <p>The one thing for certain is that there's no stopping this formidable demon from getting what she wants, even if she doesn't seem to know what her own end game is.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
